WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:05.552
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:12.631
I'm a king cobra.

3
00:00:13.682 --> 00:00:17.313
We are venomous snakes.

4
00:00:18.961 --> 00:00:21.507
What are venomous snakes?

5
00:00:22.577 --> 00:00:26.897
Venomous snakes have a special poison.

6
00:00:28.756 --> 00:00:32.016
The venom is in our fangs.

7
00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:38.395
We can kill our enemies by biting them.

8
00:00:40.676 --> 00:00:42.788
Where do you live?

9
00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:48.681
We live in India, China, and Southeast Asia.

10
00:00:49.797 --> 00:00:54.510
We like rain forests and grasslands.

11
00:00:56.047 --> 00:00:58.080
What do you eat?

12
00:00:59.277 --> 00:01:04.202
King cobras mostly eat other snakes and lizards.

13
00:01:05.806 --> 00:01:10.272
Sometimes we eat other small animals. But we

14
00:01:11.594 --> 00:01:16.062
can last for days without food.

15
00:01:17.671 --> 00:01:19.883
Who are your enemies?

16
00:01:20.648 --> 00:01:24.104
Humans are our biggest enemy.

17
00:01:26.726 --> 00:01:31.112
They destroy our homes and collect us.

18
00:01:33.316 --> 00:01:36.687
How do you protect yourself from humans?

19
00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:40.496
We usually just try to escape.

20
00:01:44.677 --> 00:01:48.824
But we can stand up very tall.

21
00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:55.449
And we can hiss loudly.

22
00:01:57.851 --> 00:02:00.089
Is that your nest?

23
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:05.820
Yes. Other snakes don't build nests.

24
00:02:08.169 --> 00:02:10.785
But king cobras do.

25
00:02:12.086 --> 00:02:15.342
And we guard them closely!

26
00:02:20.266 --> 00:02:23.547
Uh-oh. I hear footsteps.

27
00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:28.453
I have to protect my eggs. Hiss!

28
00:02:29.121 --> 00:02:31.660
Good-bye, King Cobra!

